  "sections": {
    "main": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:names.custom_liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- ============================================\n     NUR PROTOCOL — REVIEWS / TESTIMONIALS PAGE\n     12 real tester verbatims (source: Nur Protocol Verbatim file\n     provided by the user). French verbatims translated to English\n     for site consistency, meaning preserved faithfully. No star\n     ratings invented — only Sara Hassan's explicit \"4 stars\" is\n     reflected in her own quote text. Order interleaves gender,\n     cultural background and language of origin so no block of\n     similar names reads as a cluster.\n     ============================================ -->\n\n<style>\n  .nur-reviews {\n    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #FAFAF8;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__hero {\n    max-width: 680px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 100px 40px 72px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__title {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.8vw, 46px);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.18;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__title em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__lead {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: #8A8A8A;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 28px;\n    max-width: 1280px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 40px 48px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__card {\n    background-color: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,169,110,0.2);\n    padding: 32px 28px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__mark {\n    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n    font-size: 36px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n    opacity: 0.5;\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__stars {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 2px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__star {\n    width: 13px;\n    height: 13px;\n    fill: #C8A96E;\n    stroke: none;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__star--empty {\n    fill: #E3DFD5;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__card-title {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.1px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__card-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #5A5A5A;\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__card-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    padding-top: 16px;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.2);\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__avatar {\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 30px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: #F0EDE8;\n    color: #8A7A5C;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__name {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__note {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto 100px;\n    padding: 0 40px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-reviews__note p {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #A0A0A0;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n    .nur-reviews__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .nur-reviews__hero { padding: 64px 20px 48px; }\n    .nur-reviews__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 0 20px 72px; gap: 20px; }\n    .nur-reviews__note { margin-top: -48px; margin-bottom: 64px; padding: 0 20px; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"nur-reviews\">\n\n  <section class=\"nur-reviews__hero\">\n    <span class=\"nur-reviews__eyebrow\">Real Testers</span>\n    <h1 class=\"nur-reviews__title\">What they're telling us<br><em>in their own words</em></h1>\n    <p class=\"nur-reviews__lead\">Unedited feedback from early Nur Protocol testers, good and mixed alike.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"nur-reviews__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">Great product and a very clever concept</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">Everything went perfectly and I'm really happy with the product. The combination of the LED mask and the AI Skin Coach is what makes it stand out for me. It's really convenient to have guidance directly in the app instead of having to figure out your routine yourself. A very interesting and innovative approach to skincare.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">MT</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Michael Thompson</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">I'm 52 and really impressed with the results</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I've been using Nur Protocol for about five weeks now. My complexion looks clearer and more even, and the little imperfections I had have almost disappeared. I can also see a real improvement in my fine lines, although I haven't noticed much change yet on deeper wrinkles. What I really love is Nur AI: I don't have to constantly wonder what my skin needs. I use the mask once a week and I'm definitely going to keep going.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">AA</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Aisha Al-Mansouri</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">Encouraging results</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I'm pleasantly surprised by the first results. My skin looks clearer and brighter after just a few uses. I also really love the Nur Skin Coach AI concept: having a protocol adapted to your own skin means you don't have to figure out what might work on your own. It's genuinely reassuring and much easier to fit into a routine.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">CM</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Claire Moreau</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star nur-reviews__star--empty\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">Very good, and I love the personalised approach</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I'm really happy with the mask so far. It's easy to use and I particularly like that Skin Coach AI gives you a protocol based on your own skin rather than the same routine for everyone. That personalised approach makes a real difference. The only reason I'm giving 4 stars is the price, which I find quite high. &#9786;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">SH</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Sara Hassan</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star nur-reviews__star--empty\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">A completely different skincare experience</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I was already interested in LED therapy, but the AI coach is what really caught my attention. Having an app that helps you understand your skin and recommends a protocol adapted to you makes the experience much more personal. I've only been using it for a short time, but I'm already very impressed by the concept and the technology behind it.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">SB</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Sarah Bennett</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">Very encouraging early results</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I've only been using it for a few days and I'm already satisfied. My skin tolerates it very well, no irritation, and my complexion looks fresher. I think it'll take more time to really judge the effect on fine lines and glow, but I really like that the app guides you through using the mask. The personalised protocol is a genuinely good idea.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">N</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Nadia</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">A very innovative concept</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">What surprised me most is the combination of LED therapy with an AI skin coach. It feels much more advanced than simply putting on an LED mask and following a standard routine. The AI makes the experience feel personalised and much more engaging. I'm still at the beginning of my journey, but my first impression is really positive.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">MA</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Mariam Al-Khaldi</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star nur-reviews__star--empty\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">A very positive experience</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I'm really happy with my purchase. The mask is pleasant and easy to use, and I especially appreciate the personalised side of the experience. The Skin Coach AI is a real plus: you feel guided and have a better sense of which protocol to follow for your skin's needs. That's what makes the concept particularly interesting to me.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">S</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Sophie</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">Excellent results in a short time</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I'm genuinely surprised by how quickly I started noticing a difference. My skin looks fresher and more luminous, and the overall experience has been very positive. The skin coach is also a real plus: having an AI guide you and adapt the protocol to your skin makes the treatment feel much more personalised.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">NA</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Noura Al-Rashid</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">Simple, personalised and easy to follow</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I'm very happy with my purchase. The mask itself is simple to use, but what I really appreciate is the personalised guidance through the app. Nur Skin Coach AI makes it much easier to understand what my skin needs and which protocol to follow. I don't feel like I'm just using an LED mask without knowing whether I'm doing the right thing.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">E</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Emma</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star nur-reviews__star--empty\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star nur-reviews__star--empty\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">A nice improvement, with real tech behind it</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I don't have enough hindsight yet to fully judge the mask's effectiveness, although I've already noticed a fairly clear improvement in my hormonal acne in just a few days. Having personalised guidance feels really different from a simple LED mask. On the other hand, I found the strap system not very practical, especially for the neck, where they could be longer.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">EM</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">&Eacute;lise Morreti</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-reviews__card\">\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__mark\">&ldquo;</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__stars\"><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg><svg class=\"nur-reviews__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><polygon points=\"10,1.5 12.6,7 18.5,7.6 14,11.8 15.3,17.5 10,14.5 4.7,17.5 6,11.8 1.5,7.6 7.4,7\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 class=\"nur-reviews__card-title\">Perfect 100%</h3>\n      <p class=\"nur-reviews__card-text\">I love the whole concept, especially having the Nur Skin Coach AI in the app. It makes the experience feel completely different from a traditional LED mask. You're not left wondering what to do or which protocol is right for you. Everything feels much more guided and personalised.</p>\n      <div class=\"nur-reviews__card-footer\">\n        <div class=\"nur-reviews__avatar\">LF</div>\n        <span class=\"nur-reviews__name\">Layla Fahad</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"nur-reviews__note\">\n    <p>Reviews are lightly edited for length and, where the original was in French, translated into English. Nothing in the substance of any review is changed.</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n",
